RP MotionStudio is a modified version of Motion Studio by appariciojunior and
contributors. It is not the official Motion Studio application.

The pre-existing base remains subject to the notices in LICENSE. That file has
not been replaced or relicensed by this update.

Additional template families (arc, wheelEllipse, revolve, spinner, wipeReveal)
and the shared effect shaders/adapters were imported from Motion Studio commit
dba311caff2e78c621c17f008eb1bc3f71f361b5. That upstream revision publishes these
additions under Apache-2.0. Its complete licence and NOTICE are retained in:

    licenses/motion-studio-upstream.APACHE-2.0
    licenses/motion-studio-upstream.NOTICE

Local changes adapt the effect adapters to the existing renderers, correct
Pixi coordinate mapping, isolate instance caches and release GPU resources.
Template integration retains existing project IDs and poses; the unsupported
squircle toggle is withheld from Spinner. New editor features include mixed
layer ordering, duplication, recovery, motion paths and local destinations.

The Liquid Glass shader includes MIT-licensed lens mathematics by Yousuf Soomro
(2026), from https://github.com/Yousuf-developer/liquid-glass-carousel. Its full
MIT notice remains in effects/liquidGlass.ts and the upstream NOTICE above.

The dependency list and asset descriptions in the upstream NOTICE describe
that upstream revision. The dependencies used by this fork are recorded in
package.json and package-lock.json. No upstream reference images, private
projects, user-uploaded artwork or local test captures are included here.
